Change which language the bot replies in, for you only, in this room only.

  :lang          see current language + available codes
  :lang id       use Bahasa Indonesia
  :lang en       use English
  :lang auto     go back to detecting from your client
  :lang list     see who in this room has picked a language

The bot reads the <lang> tag from your client's presence as the automatic default.
If you pick one manually with :lang <code>, that choice sticks until you type
:lang auto or :lang list.
